  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/blob/1.18/assets/ui/banner.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/raw/1.18/assets/ui/banner.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/blob/1.18/assets/ui/banner_cave.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/raw/1.18/assets/ui/banner_cave.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f78246c17e8bf1d5ed1ac969809eef1548c96974cc61234239cdeee0a43b50b2b%252f68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f73746172732f447261796c61722f696e6d6973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/78246c17e8bf1d5ed1ac969809eef1548c96974cc61234239cdeee0a43b50b2b/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f73746172732f447261796c61722f696e6d6973\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f0902b825392d29f78559564927eaf719a7e2babd37a57f677a8e9431f0dca811%252f68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6c6963656e73652f447261796c61722f696e6d6973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0902b825392d29f78559564927eaf719a7e2babd37a57f677a8e9431f0dca811/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6c6963656e73652f447261796c61722f696e6d6973\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>Inmis 是一款专为 Fabric Loader 打造的背包模组。它需要单独安装 Fabric API。默认情况下，你可以右键点击背包来打开它，或者按下 <code>B</code> 键打开背包栏中第一个可用的背包。背包可以装备在胸甲护甲栏位中，并使用相同的快捷键打开。</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis#compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>兼容性</h3>\n<p>如果你与 Inmis 一起安装 Trinkets，你将能够在背包饰品栏位中装备 Inmis 背包。</p>\n<p>想要预览背包内容？试试 ShulkerBoxTooltip！</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis#configuration-\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>配置&nbsp;⚙</h3>\n<p>Inmis 的所有设置均可通过游戏目录下的 <code>config/inmis.json</code> 文件进行完全自定义。这将允许你禁用主背包栏的背包功能、要求玩家必须在护甲栏穿戴背包，甚至支持添加你自己的自定义背包！</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis#license-\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>许可证&nbsp;📃</h3>\n<p>Inmis 采用 MIT 许可证授权。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/blob/1.18/assets/ui/Items.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/inmis/raw/1.18/assets/ui/Items.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
